### 5. Recommendation

Apply the `fitTerminalInstance` helper across the 3 call sites (`terminalInstanceFactory.ts`, `TerminalPane.tsx`, `terminalHostManager.ts`) while keeping `terminalOutputScheduler.ts` untouched. This achieves viewport realignment on reactivation and fitting with zero regression to LRU caching or user scrollback behavior.
